        <body>
            <div xml:id="d11">

                <pb facs="0173" n="7" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg7"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 811.3335/26</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-07-25T12:00:00-04:16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 25, 1917, noon</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Fleet escorted by Argentine squadron delayed 3 hours by fog, arrived safely in
                    the north basin at sunset. Crowd estimated at two hundred thousand received
                    them. Minister for Foreign Affairs gave a private welcome dinner: guests Vice
                    President, Minister of Marine, Papal Nuncio, Spanish Ambassador, Mayor of City,
                    Presidents Jockey Club and Reception Committee and ladies.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stimson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
